{"product_id":"childrens-parties","title":"Childrens Parties","description":"\u003cp\u003eCovering every aspect of organizing and running a successful children's party, this book sets out all the potential pitfalls and things to consider when organizing a party. The book looks at where to have the party, who to invite and what to do in case of rain or accidents. Structured around 20 party themes, from Hallowe'en and pirates to a disco party for older children, the book goes through each stage with suggestions for key attractions - including games and party food. Both indoor and outdoor activities are included and fun food ranges from marzipan ghosts' eyeballs to a pop star birthday cake.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Juliet Moxley\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780091821517\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 134\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 193 x 267\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Bookhero.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41750684401817,"sku":"3RG9780091821517","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/childrens-parties-344161.jpg?v=1694789956","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/childrens-parties","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}